{"seq":32,"slug":"disaster-recovery-business-continuity","title":"灾备与业务连续性","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity","rating":{"composite":4.14,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 灾备与业务连续性\n\n当整个云区域因光缆切断、电力中断或软件缺陷而同时不可用时，决定一家企业是在数分钟内恢复服务还是停摆数天的关键，正是灾备与业务连续性体系的成熟度。本 hub 聚焦于\"系统级灾难来临后，如何把服务拉回到可接受的状态\"这一核心问题，覆盖从目标定义到架构设计、从数据保护到切换恢复、从演练验证到持续运营的完整生命周期。\n\n本 hub 与同一 category 下的兄弟 hub 有明确分工：分布式系统（distributed-systems）讨论正常运行时的一致性、分区容忍与共识协议；混沌工程（chaos-engineering）关注如何主动注入故障以发现薄弱环节；韧性工程与故障恢复（resilience-engineering-failure-recovery）侧重单服务或组件级别的容错模式（重试、熔断、降级）。而本 hub 处理的是更大爆炸半径的场景——当故障超出单组件自愈能力、需要跨区域或跨站点恢复整个业务栈时的策略、技术与流程。\n\n全 hub 由四条主线递进展开。第一章\"灾备基础与策略\"建立核心度量（RPO/RTO）、灾难分类体系与四大架构模式的选型框架，为后续所有技术决策提供评估坐标。第二章\"数据保护与复制\"深入数据层——备份、复制、存储恢复三大手段如何协作以满足不同 RPO 要求。第三章\"故障切换与恢复\"进入运行时——主主/主备拓扑、自动化切换机制以及云区域级故障的应对方案。第四章\"演练与运营\"闭合循环——通过演练验证恢复能力、用手册与自动化降低人为失误、以业务连续性计划将技术方案嵌入组织治理。\n\n推荐学习路径：先完成第一章建立概念框架，再按自身关注点选择第二章（偏数据工程）或第三章（偏平台架构），最后用第四章将知识转化为可执行的运营实践。\n\n前置知识：读者应具备基本的云计算概念（区域、可用区、托管服务）、网络基础（DNS、负载均衡）、以及对数据库事务与一致性的初步理解。具备分布式系统或 SRE 实践经验者将获得更深层次的收益。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"灾备基础与策略","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rpo-rto-planning","title":"RPO 与 RTO 规划","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/fundamentals/rpo-rto-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"disaster-classification-risk","title":"灾难分类与风险评估","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/fundamentals/disaster-classification-risk"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dr-architecture-patterns","title":"灾备架构模式","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/fundamentals/dr-architecture-patterns"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-protection","title":"数据保护与复制","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/data-protection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"backup-strategies","title":"备份策略与实施","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/data-protection/backup-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-replication-sync","title":"数据复制与同步技术","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/data-protection/data-replication-sync"},{"seq":3,"slug":"storage-recovery-techniques","title":"存储恢复技术","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/data-protection/storage-recovery-techniques"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"failover-recovery","title":"故障切换与恢复","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/failover-recovery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"active-active-passive","title":"主主与主备架构","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/failover-recovery/active-active-passive"},{"seq":2,"slug":"automated-failover","title":"自动化故障切换","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/failover-recovery/automated-failover"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cloud-region-failure","title":"云区域故障应对","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/failover-recovery/cloud-region-failure"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"testing-operations","title":"演练与运营","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/testing-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dr-testing-drills","title":"灾备演练与测试","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/testing-operations/dr-testing-drills"},{"seq":2,"slug":"runbook-automation","title":"恢复手册与自动化","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/testing-operations/runbook-automation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"business-continuity-planning","title":"业务连续性计划","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/disaster-recovery-business-continuity/testing-operations/business-continuity-planning"}]}]}